# Tauri build artifacts
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/WixTools/

# Capability JSON schemas regenerated by tauri-build on every build. All four
# are byte-identical (they describe the capability file format, not the
# platform), so tracking them meant carrying the same 129 KB document three
# times over — and a macOS build, which writes the one name nobody had
# committed, left the tree permanently dirty. Ignored rather than completed
# with a fourth copy: this is what the upstream `create-tauri-app` template
# does, and the files come back on the next build.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# JSON backup files created by storage layer
*.bak.json
.env
.env.local
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/

# Machine-list exports (contain real hostnames)
eldrun-machines.json
